ook:pound|pound]] [[Cookbook:Ground beef|ground beef]] \n*2 Italian [[Cookbook:Sausage|sausages]], removed from casings \n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]]s [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]] [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]]s chopped [[Cookbook:Bell Pepper|green bell pepper]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:clove|clove]] [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]] \n*1 [[Cookbook:cup|cup]] chopped canned [[Cookbook:tomato|tomato]]es,\n*3 [[Cookbook:ounce|ounce]]s [[Cookbook:Tomato Paste|tomato paste]] \n*½ [[Cookbook:cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:water|water]]\n*1 [[Cookbook:teaspoon|teaspoon]] dried [[Cookbook:basil|basil]] leaves \n*½ [[Cookbook:tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Chili Powder|chili powder]] \n*½ [[Cookbook:teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Red Pepper|red pepper]] \n*½ [[Cookbook:teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:salt|salt]]\n*½ [[Cookbook:teaspoon|teaspoon]] dried [[Cookbook:oregano|oregano]] \n*1 dash of [[Cookbook:sugar|sugar]] \n*1 dash of [[Cookbook:pepper|black pepper]] \n*1 [[Cookbook:egg|egg]], slightly beaten \n*8 [[Cookbook:ounce|ounce]]s [[Cookbook:ricotta|ricotta]] [[Cookbook:cheese|cheese]] \n*¼ [[Cookbook:cup|cup]] [[Cookbook:Parmesan Cheese|Parmesan cheese]] \n\n==Procedure== \n#Cook mostaccioli until [[Cookbook:al dente|al dente]] in boiling salted water. Drain and set aside. \n#In [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|skillet]], combine meat, sausages, onion, green pepper and garlic. Cook while breaking up meat, until browned. Drain off fat. \n#To the meat, add all remaining ingredients, except egg and cheeses. Bring meat sauce to a boil. Reduce heat. \n#Cover and [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] for 15–20 minutes, stirring occasionally.\n#Combine egg and cheeses. To assemble, stir cooked pasta into meat sauce. Place half in buttered 1-quart [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking dish]]. \n#Spread cheese mixture evenly over the top. cover with remaining pasta. \n#Bake, covered, at [[Cookbook:Oven Temperatures|350°F]] for 30–35 minutes or until cooked through.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using ground beef]]\n[[Category:Recipes for casserole]]\n[[Category:Recipes using pasta and noodles]]\n[[Category:Recipes using basil]]\n[[Category:Recipes using green bell pepper]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ricotta]]\n[[Category:Recipes using parmesan]]\n[[Category:Recipes using chile]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using garlic]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Pasta, Meat and Cheese Casserole (Mostaccioli)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 cup uncooked mostaccioli pasta","sourceText":"1 cup uncooked mostaccioli pasta","amountText":"1 cup uncooked mostaccioli pasta","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"½ pound ground beef","sourceText":"½ pound ground beef","amountText":"½ pound ground beef","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 Italian sausages, removed from casings","sourceText":"2 Italian sausages, removed from casings","amountText":"2 Italian sausages, removed from casings","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 tablespoons chopped onion","sourceText":"2 tablespoons chopped onion","amountText":"2 tablespoons chopped onion","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"2 tablespoons chopped green bell pepper","sourceText":"2 tablespoons chopped green bell pepper","amountText":"2 tablespoons chopped green bell pepper","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-6","name":"1 clove minced garlic","sourceText":"1 clove minced garlic","amountText":"1 clove minced garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-7","name":"1 cup chopped canned tomatoes,","sourceText":"1 cup chopped canned tomatoes,","amountText":"1 cup chopped canned tomatoes,","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-8","name":"